{"name":"Inner Sanctum","hex":"#78a6b5","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"inner sanctum","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A sanctum sanctorum, a Holy of Holies."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/inner_sanctum"}],"entries":[{"title":"Inner Sanctum (1948 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Inner Sanctum is a 1948 American horror mystery film directed by Lew Landers and starring Charles Russell and Mary Beth Hughes. based on the Simon & Schuster book series of the same name and the Inner Sanctum Mystery radio series. A previous film series of the show had been produced by Universal Pictures until 1945. It is the first and only film of M.R.S. productions, the initials of Richard B. Morros, Samuel Rheiner and Walter Shenson."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/a/ac/Insacpos.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inner_Sanctum_(1948_film)","wikidata":"Q6035554"},{"title":"Inner Sanctum (1991 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Inner Sanctum is a 1991 American crime erotic thriller film which stars Tanya Roberts, Margaux Hemingway, Joseph Bottoms and Valerie Wildman, and was written by Mark Thomas McGee and directed by Fred Olen Ray."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/1/15/Inner_movie_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inner_Sanctum_(1991_film)","wikidata":"Q6035559"},{"title":"Inner Sanctum (album)","blocks":[{"text":"Inner Sanctum is the third live album and video by English duo Pet Shop Boys, released on 12 April 2019 by the duo's label x2. It was recorded in July 2018 during the band's four-day Inner Sanctum residency at the Royal Opera House in London as part of the Super Tour. The show was designed by Es Devlin and directed by David Barnard, and released on DVD, Blu-ray and CD. The DVD/Blu-ray and CD release also includes a recording of the duo playing at Rock in Rio on 17 September 2017."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/c/cc/Pet_Shop_Boys_-_Inner_Sanctum.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inner_Sanctum_(album)","wikidata":"Q65058685"}],"images":[],"sounds":{},"pictures":[{"title":"Black-headed weaver (Ploceus cucullatus bohndorffi) male nest building","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/71/Black-headed_weaver_%28Ploceus_cucullatus_bohndorffi%29_male_nest_building.jpg/500px-Black-headed_weaver_%28Ploceus_cucullatus_bohndorffi%29_male_nest_building.jpg","ratio":1.5,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Black-headed_weaver_(Ploceus_cucullatus_bohndorffi)_male_nest_building.jpg","share":0.635625},{"title":"Alexei Leonov","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f8/Alexei_Leonov.jpg/500px-Alexei_Leonov.jpg","ratio":0.7999479708636836,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Alexei_Leonov.jpg","share":0.254375},{"title":"20131003 Schoeningen Palaeon DSC08394 PtrQs","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ca/20131003_Schoeningen_Palaeon_DSC08394_PtrQs.jpg/500px-20131003_Schoeningen_Palaeon_DSC08394_PtrQs.jpg","ratio":1.5,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20131003_Schoeningen_Palaeon_DSC08394_PtrQs.jpg","share":0.1625},{"title":"Banknote portrait pattern (Intaglio print, tactile effect)","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fc/Banknote_portrait_pattern_%28Intaglio_print%2C_tactile_effect%29.jpg/500px-Banknote_portrait_pattern_%28Intaglio_print%2C_tactile_effect%29.jpg","ratio":1.3387860525182953,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Banknote_portrait_pattern_(Intaglio_print,_tactile_effect).jpg","share":0.09375},{"title":"Trees rising out of Cheow Lan Lake, blue sky, eternal summer in Surat Thani","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/